{"availability":"available","full":"XiHanFun/XiHan.BasicApp","name":"XiHan.BasicApp","description":"A visually stunning, general-purpose mid-to-back-office core framework built upon XiHan.Framework and XiHan.UI. It serves as a foundational application within the XiHanFun open-source ecosystem, featuring a comprehensive architecture comprising a base framework, components, and applications.","category":"Developer tools","language":"C#","stars":228,"forks":58,"created":"2024-08-13T21:37:04Z","updated":"2026-10-08T15:50:18Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://basicapp.docs.xihanfun.com","topics":["admin","rbac","xihan"],"demo":"https://basicapp.xihanfun.com/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:39.233Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:39.233Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:39.233Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T19:51:39.233Z","stars":228,"forks":58}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A beautifully crafted general-purpose admin kernel built on XiHan.Framework and XiHan.UI","A .NET backend on XiHan.Framework, a Vue frontend on XiHan.UI Multi-tenancy · RBAC with data scopes and field masking · Code generation · Realtime","XiHan.BasicApp is a decoupled frontend/backend system. The backend follows DDD layering — writes go through application services, reads through query services — and application services are exposed directly as REST endpoints by the dynamic API convention. The frontend is Vue + TypeScript + XiHan.UI, and the backend .NET + XiHan.Framework. Identity, permissions, tenancy and auditing are built in, so it works both as the starting point for an admin project and as a reference for full-stack .NET + Vue practice. XiHan.BasicApp is the basic application of the XiHanFun open-source ecosystem."],"features":["Close to 90 tables, more than 50 pages and over 300 permission codes come built in. This section covers only what sets the project apart; the page-by-page capability list lives in the feature list on the docs site…","Light and dark themes: Not a class toggled at the root — every page and every component has been color-checked in both; switching ripples out from the point you clicked","One color, a full palette: 21 traditional Chinese color presets plus any custom color; Material You dynamic color derives secondary, container and tinted neutral tones from the brand color, so changing it takes no CSS…","Preference center: Tune 7 layouts, corner radius, density, font size, tab style, page transitions and watermark; preferences, column settings, search habits and dashboard boards sync to the cloud and apply live on your…","Dynamic Island feedback: Borrowed from phones — sign-in, uploads, exports, server-side task progress and reconnects gather in a small island at the top, with progress rings and retry buttons inside, instead of a screen…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/XiHanFun/XiHan.BasicApp/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9e451a7ea3ae99735685c8d7f9b004d0cb9a0b2095aa3e6d1e544ab8074166de","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:39.363Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:39.363Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A beautifully crafted general-purpose admin kernel built on XiHan.Framework and XiHan.UI","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/XiHanFun/XiHan.BasicApp/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Dynamic Island feedback: Borrowed from phones — sign-in, uploads, exports, server-side task progress and reconnects gather in a small island at the top, with progress rings and retry buttons inside, instead of a screen full of toasts","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/XiHanFun/XiHan.BasicApp/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"The server owns the session: Every request reads a server-side permission snapshot instead of trusting token claims, so revocations and forced sign-outs take effect at once; a locked screen answers every request with 423 and resumes after unlocking, no new sign-in needed","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/XiHanFun/XiHan.BasicApp/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"9e451a7ea3ae99735685c8d7f9b004d0cb9a0b2095aa3e6d1e544ab8074166de","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/XiHanFun/XiHan.BasicApp/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:39.364Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T15:50:18Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/XiHanFun/XiHan.BasicApp/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:39.365Z","hash":"9e451a7ea3ae99735685c8d7f9b004d0cb9a0b2095aa3e6d1e544ab8074166de","originalBytes":25360,"storedBytes":25360,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["backend","frontend","one","project","data","modules","pages","permission","color","framework","xihan.ui","chat","code","dynamic","net","optional","application","built","each","every","live","page","tenants","xihan.basicapp","architecture","base","change","codes","component","engineering","foundation","full","inspiring","only","parts","per","services","src","tenant","any","assistant","both","chinese","development","list","menus","palette","password","permissions","platform","plus","role","search","server","settings","sign-in","sources","through","vue","when","workflow","xihan.framework","yes","access","account","after","api","center","column","command","database","default","demo","direct","exports","generation","island","layer","library","license","module","notes","other","out","over","packages","place","pnpm","printing","providers","request","required","screen","see","side","time","two","types","user","view","visual","works","admin","apis","audit","author","bash","being","buttons","cannot","cloud","composing","dashboard","department","dependencies","documentation","drag","enforced","export","features","files","group","highlights","in-app","inheritance","isolation","kernel","log","main","own","postgresql","print","progress","qdrant","read","reads","redis","repository","routes